# The sample pack's tune for Oreburgh Gate's lower floor (plan 16 · T15). An original melody for this game: a short,
# gentle walk in G major on a celesta over a soft pad.
title Lantern Walk
tempo 84
meter 4/4
reverb 0.4
night none

track lead celesta vol=0.6 pan=0 rev=0.4
  L o5 d4 g4 b4 a4 | o5 g2 d2 | o5 e4 g4 c4 e4 | o5 d1 |
  o5 b4 a4 g4 e4 | o5 d2 g2 | o5 a4 f+4 d4 e4 | o5 g1 |

track pad pad vol=0.3 pan=-0.2 rev=0.5
  L o3 (g b d)1 | (g b d)1 | (c e g)1 | (d f+ a)1 |
  (e g b)1 | (g b d)1 | (d f+ a)1 | (g b d)1 |
